# Belt-and-suspenders for precommit/test-gate.sh's throwaway sandbox repo
# (issue #169). Root cause found and fixed (precommit/test-gate.sh now
# unsets GIT_DIR/GIT_INDEX_FILE/etc before creating any sandbox, since
# those variables -- inherited from a real hook invocation -- silently
# redirected the sandbox's `git add`/`git config --local` into THIS repo's
# index and shared config regardless of `git -C`). Kept anyway as cheap
# insurance: a bare `git add probe.txt`/`git add "$sb/probe.txt"` cannot
# stage an ignored path here without -f, which nothing in this tree ever
# passes.
/probe.txt
